          <code code="51847-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Assessment &amp; Plan"/>
          <title>Assessment &amp; Plan</title>
          <text>
            <list>
              <item>1. Palpitations / Premature ventricular contractions (ICD-10 I49.3): Ordered 14-day ambulatory continuous ECG patch monitor.</item>
              <item>2. Systolic ejection murmur (ICD-10 R01.1): Ordered Transthoracic Echocardiogram (TTE) with Doppler to evaluate aortic valve morphology and ventricular function.</item>
              <item>3. Essential Hypertension (ICD-10 I10): Blood pressure today is 134/86 mmHg. Continue Amlodipine 5mg and HCTZ 12.5mg daily. Keep home BP log.</item>
              <item>4. Follow-up: Return to clinic in 4 weeks after completion of Holter monitor and echocardiogram.</item>
            </list>
          </text>
